## AI Features (REQUIRED — YC S25/W26 Mandate)

Every DClaw app MUST ship an AI Copilot as its first P0 feature. Define at minimum:

- **AI Copilot** (`POST /api/v1/copilot/chat`): Domain-aware chat backed by LLM + optional RAG. Answers questions, explains data, and suggests next actions.
- **{AI_FEATURE_2}:** (e.g., Anomaly detection, classification, forecasting)
- **{AI_FEATURE_3}:** (e.g., Auto-summarization, recommendations, content generation)

The copilot must:
1. Be contextually aware of the app's domain data
2. Use RAG over the app's knowledge base where applicable
3. Suggest next actions, not just answer questions
4. Be accessible from every page via floating chat or sidebar
5. Fall back to local Ollama when cloud is unavailable

## API Endpoints (v1.0)

```
# {PRIMARY_ENTITY}
GET    /api/v1/{entities}              → List (with query filters)
POST   /api/v1/{entities}              → Create
GET    /api/v1/{entities}/{id}         → Get
PUT    /api/v1/{entities}/{id}         → Update
DELETE /api/v1/{entities}/{id}         → Delete

# {CHILD_ENTITY}
GET    /api/v1/{child_entities}        → List (filter by parent)
POST   /api/v1/{child_entities}        → Create
GET    /api/v1/{child_entities}/{id}   → Get
PUT    /api/v1/{child_entities}/{id}   → Update
DELETE /api/v1/{child_entities}/{id}   → Delete

# Dashboard
GET    /api/v1/dashboard               → Aggregate stats

# AI Copilot
POST   /api/v1/copilot/chat           → Send message, get AI response (streaming)
GET    /api/v1/copilot/history        → Conversation history
```

