## Non-Functional Requirements

- Backend tests: 70%+ coverage (pytest + pytest-asyncio, pinned to 0.24.0)
- Frontend: Responsive, Tailwind CSS + pre-built UI components in `src/components/ui/`
- Docker: All services start with `docker compose up -d`; healthchecks MUST pass
- No mock data — all entities persisted to PostgreSQL
- AI Copilot accessible from every page
- All routes protected by Logto JWT (except `/health`)
- `frontend/public/dclaw-manifest.json` present for DPanel registration
- Health endpoint at `/health` returns `{"status": "ok"}`

